  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTucked away at the rear of the property, 2/25 Wolsley Avenue offers a peaceful and private retreat, combining generous living space, versatile accommodation and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 210m² across three levels, this beautifully renovated cedar-clad home features three bedrooms, a versatile ground-floor flexi-room and three bathrooms, making it an ideal choice for families, extended family living or those seeking additional space to work from home.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout offers flexibility for changing family needs. The ground-floor flexi-room benefits from its own independent access, making it ideal for teenagers, extended family members, guests or a home office. With a bathroom on every level, the home provides added convenience and privacy for everyone.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated throughout, the property is move-in ready, allowing you to settle in and enjoy without the time, cost or hassle of undertaking renovations. Head to the top floor to discover impressive Sky Tower views, adding an extra touch of appeal to this versatile home.\r\n\r\nLocation is another key advantage. The property is within the sought-after school zones for Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School, offering excellent options for families prioritising education.\r\n\r\nShopping centres, local amenities and motorway connections are also conveniently accessible, making daily errands and commuting straightforward.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Private rear position, away from the street\r\n• Approximately 210m² of interior living across three levels\r\n• Three bedrooms plus a versatile ground-floor flexi-room\r\n• Three bathrooms, with one on every level\r\n• Independent ground-floor access\r\n• Attractive cedar-clad exterior\r\n• Recently renovated and move-in ready\r\n• Impressive Sky Tower views from the top floor\r\n• Sought-after school zones\r\n• Convenient access to shopping, local amenities and motorways\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking for a comfortable family home, flexible accommodation for extended family or a property that can adapt to your lifestyle, this home offers a compelling combination of space, privacy and versatility.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the space. Appreciate the privacy. Make it your own.",
